+The calendar of an existing Stalwart Mailserver v0.15.5 container, with modifications to it's "config.toml"-file, and integrated with a number of free Cloudflare services, can be used full, natively, perfectly, without client side extensions in Outlook-client on Windows 11 as well as Android 15. This is achieved by a docker container written in Rust v1.94.0, running alongside the existing Stalwart Mailserver v0.15.5 container, and a number of free Cloudflare services. 
